{{PCExclusive}}
'''Momo''' is an [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that is exclusive to the [[Minna de Nyanko Daisensou/PostPet Collaboration Event|VIP collaboration Post Pet Momo's Optical Line Pioneering Story! Salesman Nyanmaru Tour]], only available in the [[Minna de Nyanko Daisensou|PC version]], available from the 19th December 2017 to 29th December 2017.

{{Cat Info
|ID = 904
|rarity = EX
|version = PC
|name1 = Momo
|name2 = Santa Momo & Cat
|image1 = 10904 1.png
|image2 = 10904 2.png
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Santa Momo & Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
This unit has very little usage due to its poor DPS and most importantly, Single Target. Even though it has above average range, [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] has more range and overall better stats. On top of that, it has no ability whatsoever, making it good against nothing in particular.

{{Job|Classification = User Rank Dump}}

