==Trivia==
*This unit and its [[New Year Momo (PC Special Cat)|New Year counterpart]] are based off of the famous toy brand [[wikipedia:Bearbrick|Be@rbrick]].
*The words shown in the photo above said メリクリ (Merikuri), which is Merry Christmas ('''メリ'''ー'''クリ'''スマス (Merīkurisumasu). Bolded parts are the words shown in the short version) in Japanese but short form
*The drawstrings on Santa Momo's shirt are larger in-battle than they are in her icons.

